    "\n",
    "Um zur Angular-Dokumentation beizutragen, sieh dir die [Angular.dev README](adev/README.md) an.\n",
    "\n",
    "## Entwicklungsumgebung einrichten\n",
    "\n",
    "### Voraussetzungen\n",
    "\n",
    "- Installiere [Node.js], das den [Node Package Manager][npm] enthält.\n",
    "\n",
    "### Projekt einrichten\n",
    "\n",
    "Installiere die Angular CLI global:\n",
    "\n",
    "```\n",
    "npm install -g @angular/cli\n",
    "```\n",
    "\n",
    "Arbeitsbereich erstellen:\n",
    "\n",
    "```\n",
    "ng new [PROJEKTNAME]\n",
    "```\n",
    "\n",
    "Anwendung starten:\n",
    "\n",
    "```\n",
    "cd [PROJEKTNAME]\n",
    "ng serve\n",
    "```\n",
    "\n",
    "Angular ist plattformübergreifend, schnell, skalierbar, hat beeindruckende Tools und wird von Millionen geliebt.\n",
